n* 1 tbsp kosher [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Pepper|black pepper]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Lemon Pepper|lemon pepper]]\n* 1 ½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Garlic Powder|garlic powder]]\n* 2 tbsp smoked [[Cookbook:Paprika|paprika]]\n* 2 tbsp dark [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]]\n* 1 ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] [[Cookbook:Tomato Paste|tomato paste]]\n* ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Honey|honey]]\n* ¼ cup apple [[Cookbook:Homemade Cider Vinegar|cider vinegar]]\n\n==Procedure==\n#Combine dry ingredients and rub onto chicken.\n#Refrigerate 1 hour.\n#Combine liquid ingredients, bring to a boil, and simmer until reduced by ⅓.\n#Place on medium [[Cookbook:Grill|grill]], and turn often, brushing with sauce when turned until interior temperature reaches {{convert|165|°F|°C}}.\n#Let rest for 10 minutes; serve.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken]]\n[[Category:Barbecue recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dark brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cayenne]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pepper]]\n[[Category:Recipes using honey]]\n[[Category:Recipes using salt]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon pepper]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Backyard BBQ Chicken","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"4 boneless skinless chicken breasts and drumsticks","sourceText":"4 boneless skinless chicken breasts and drumsticks","amountText":"4 boneless skinless chicken breasts and drumsticks","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 tbsp cayenne pepper","sourceText":"1 tbsp cayenne pepper","amountText":"1 tbsp cayenne pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 tbsp kosher salt","sourceText":"1 tbsp kosher salt","amountText":"1 tbsp kosher salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 tbsp black pepper","sourceText":"1 tbsp black pepper","amountText":"1 tbsp black pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":n